<title>CHINA: Poly Inv yearly profit jumps sharply.</title>
<headline>Poly Inv yearly profit jumps sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 2.1    vs 0.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	15.01  vs nil</p>
<p>    Net (see note)	   25.65  vs 10.61</p>
<p>    Turnover		   444.01 vs 481.38</p>
<p>    Company name	     Poly Investments Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		Sept 25-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Poly Investments is a residential and commercial property developer. Exceptional gain represents profit mainly from sales of investment property.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
